    <dashboard name='Online Retail Business Insights' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Online Retail Business Insights</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='238' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='4357' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone fixed-size='79' h='8195' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='5187' />
            <zone h='85788' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='13382'>
              <flipboard active-id='4' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='  Revenue Growth Analysis' captured-sheet='Sales Story Dashboard' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Market Performance Analysis' captured-sheet='Market / Product Story' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='     Product Revenue Drivers' captured-sheet='Market / Product Story' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='High Value Customer Analysis' captured-sheet='Customer RFM Story' id='4' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='33195' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='32087' x='64764' y='13589'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Revenue increased toward the end of 2011 due to higher customer activity.

Monthly trends show strong growth during September-November, indicating seasonal demand and increased purchasing behavior.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='29876' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='32087' x='64665' y='14108'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0'>The United Kingdom generates the majority of revenue.

Netherlands, EIRE, Germany, and France represent the strongest international markets and future growth opportunities.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='29876' hidden='true' id='8' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='32087' x='64961' y='14108'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Revenue is concentrated among a small number of high-performing products.

Quantity vs Revenue analysis shows that best-selling products are not always the highest revenue contributors.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='26556' id='9' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='32087' x='64764' y='14419'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Champion customers represent the most valuable segment.

They purchase frequently, recently, and contribute significantly to total revenue.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{8898A25C-E892-44DC-A267-6E3AB754F07E}' />
    </dashboard>
